/- English proof (translation)
Introduce `hC D T h hG hinj EX p j hj large₂ H C2 A2 CR CT ka wL wF Tn nP nW h0 Gc Prw hP hR hI hG4 hPrw`. Take `⟨hL, hf, hr, hlam, -, -⟩` from `GlobalTheory.page_two_le_L_and_signs D _ _ j _ large₂ H C2 A2 CR CT ka wL wF Tn nP nW h0 hP hR`. Take `⟨hDF, hn, hrn, hLP⟩` from `(GlobalTheory.RunWeights.weights_below D _ _ j _ large₂ H C2 A2 CR CT ka wL wF Tn nP nW h0 hj.1 hP).1 wL (by simp)`. Establish `hL0 : 0 ≤ large₂.sc.L` using `by linarith`. Establish `hRL` using `GlobalTheory.pageRows_of_le D large₂ j ka wL hL0 hDF hn hR`.

Establish `hn0 : 0 < wL.n` using `by omega`. Establish `hO : OPO large₂ (recB h.toLawsCore)`. Take `⟨-, ⟨-, -, -, -, -, -, -, -, -, -, -, -, -, -, -, -, -, -, -, -, -, -, -, -, hO, -⟩, -⟩` from `hP`. Conclude with `hO`. Take `⟨N, w0, hspan, hN, hsup⟩` from `GlobalTheory.T.exists_short_finite_generators_thetaLattice hC D T h hG large₂ j hj wL hRL hL hrn hLP`.

Establish `hcount` using `log_count_le_mul_size D _ large₂ j wL N Prw hL hn0 hRL hO hPrw hN`. Establish `hs : (0 : ℝ) ≤ wL.size`. Establish `h1` using `frn_le_size_sub_one wL`. Establish `h2 : (0 : ℝ) ≤ (D.R.f : ℝ) * D.R.r * wL.n` using `by positivity`. Move the coercions through the operations in `at h1`.

Combine the linear equalities and inequalities to obtain the conclusion. Establish `hp : 0 ≤ Real.log (D.host.pde : ℝ)` using `Real.log_natCast_nonneg _`. Establish `hZ : 0 ≤ Zb D large₂` using `by unfold Zb; positivity`. Establish `hnum` using `(GlobalTheory.T.supBounds_le_generatorConstant_mul_size D (recB h.toLawsCore) large₂ j wL D.host.pde hL hn0).2.2`. Establish `hGc` using `mul_le_mul_of_nonneg_right (hG4 D.host.pde (by simp)) hs`.

Establish `hd : 0 ≤ Real.log |((NumberField.discr (recB h.toLawsCore).KO : ℤ) : ℝ)|`. Rewrite using `[Real.log_abs]`. Conclude with `Real.log_intCast_nonneg _`. Establish `hK : 0 ≤ Real.log (Module.finrank ℚ (recB h.toLawsCore).KO : ℝ)` using `Real.log_natCast_nonneg _`. Use `(GlobalTheory.ScaledGenerators.scaled_family D _ _ j (recPJ h j hj) ka wL wF (scalOfP (recB h.toLawsCore) hinj EX p ka wL wF Tn) N w0 ((lamStar D + 2 * Real.log D.host.pde) * wL.size) _ Gc Prw (by positivity) (by positivity) (fun σ => ?_) hspan hsup (hnum.trans hGc)).2 hI hcount` and prove the remaining obligations.

Rewrite using `[sW_eq_sOf]`. Use `((GlobalTheory.RunIn.sOf_ne_zero_and_log_bounds D _ hinj EX j wL).2 σ).2.2.2.trans ?_` and prove the remaining obligations. Conclude with `mul_le_mul_of_nonneg_right (by linarith) hs`.
